WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
KATARA: Water...

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Earth...

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Fire...

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Air.

5
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Long ago, the four nations lived together in harmony.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Then, everything changed when the Fire Nation attacked.

7
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Only the Avatar, master of all four elements,

8
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.000
could stop them.

9
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.000
But when the world needed him most,

10
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.000
he vanished.

11
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.000
100 years passed,

12
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.000
and my brother and I discovered the new Avatar--

13
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.000
An airbender named Aang.

14
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.000
And although his airbending skills are great,

15
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.000
he has a lot to learn before he's ready to save anyone.

16
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.000
AANG: Oof.

17
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.000
KATARA: But I believe Aang can save the world.

18
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Aah!

19
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.000
(AANG BREATHING HEAVILY)

20
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.000
Aang?

21
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.000
Do you want to talk about it?

22
00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:46.000
Nah. Just a nightmare.

23
00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.000
I was in the Avatar state,

24
00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:51.000
But I was outside my body, watching myself.

25
00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.000
It was scary.

26
00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.000
I was scary.

27
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.000
Katara, I want you to have this.

28
00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:07.000
This amulet contains water from the spirit oasis.

29
00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:09.000
The water has unique properties.

30
00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:11.000
Don't lose it.

31
00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:12.000
Thank you, Master Pakku.

32
00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:16.000
Aang, these scrolls will help you master waterbending.

33
00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:21.000
But remember, they're no substitute for a real master.

34
00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:27.000
Sokka...

35
00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:30.000
Take care, son.

36
00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:34.000
Fly straight to the Earth Kingdom base to the east of here.

37
00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:38.000
General Fong will provide you with an escort to Omashu.

38
00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:43.000
There you'll be safe to begin your earthbending training with King Bumi.

39
00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:47.000
-Appa, yip-yip! -KATARA: Say hi to Gran-Gran for me.

40
00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:56.000
Ahh.

41
00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:59.000
This is what I've been missing.

42
00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:03.000
Who knew floating on a piece of driftwood for three weeks

43
00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:06.000
with no food or water

44
00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:09.000
and sea vultures waiting to pluck out your liver

45
00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:12.000
could make one so tense?

46
00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:18.000
I see. It's the anniversary, isn't it?

47
00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:20.000
Three years ago today, I was banished.

48
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:24.000
I lost it all. I want it back.

49
00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:28.000
I want the Avatar. I want my honor, my throne.

50
00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:31.000
I want my father not to think I'm worthless.

51
00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:37.000
I'm sure he doesn't. Why would he banish you if he didn't care?

52
00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:42.000
Uh, that came out wrong, didn't it?

53
00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:08.000
My brother and my uncle have disgraced the Fire Lord,

54
00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:10.000
and brought shame on all of us.

55
00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:14.000
You may have mixed feelings about attacking members of the royal family.

56
00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:16.000
I understand. But I assure you,

57
00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:21.000
if you hesitate, I will not hesitate to bring you down.

58
00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.000
Dismissed.

59
00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:28.000
Princess, I'm afraid the tides will not allow us to bring the ship into port

60
00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:29.000
before nightfall.

61
00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:33.000
I'm sorry, captain, but I do not know much about the tides.

62
00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.000
Can you explain something to me?

63
00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.000
Of course, your highness.

64
00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:39.000
Do the tides command this ship?

65
00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:41.000
Uh, I'm afraid I don't understand.

66
00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:45.000
You said the tides would not allow us to bring the ship in.

67
00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:48.000
Do the tides command this ship?

68
00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:49.000
No, princess.

69
00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:51.000
And if I were to have you thrown overboard,

70
00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:56.000
would the tides think twice about smashing you against the rocky shore?

71
00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.000
No, princess.

72
00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:01.000
Well, then maybe you should worry less about the tides,

73
00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:03.000
who've already made up their mind about killing you

74
00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:06.000
and worry more about me, who's still mulling it over.

75
00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:09.000
I'll pull us in.

76
00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:15.000
There it is!

77
00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:24.000
Welcome, Avatar Aang!

78
00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:27.000
I am General Fong.

79
00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:30.000
And welcome to all of you great heroes--

80
00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:35.000
Appa, Momo, brave Sokka, the mighty Katara.

81
00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:37.000
Mighty Katara? I like that.

82
00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:38.000
(FIREWORKS)

83
00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:40.000
(MOMO CHATTERING)

84
00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:47.000
Not bad. Not bad.

85
00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:50.000
Avatar Aang, we were all amazed

86
00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:53.000
at the stories of how you single-handedly wiped out

87
00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:56.000
an entire fire navy fleet at the North Pole.

88
00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:59.000
I can't imagine what it feels like to wield such devastating power.

89
00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:01.000
It's an awesome responsibility.

90
00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:04.000
I try not to think about it too much.

91
00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:08.000
Avatar, you're ready to face the Fire Lord now.

92
00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:11.000
What?! No, I'm not.

93
00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:14.000
Aang still needs to master all four elements.

94
00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:16.000
Why? With the kind of power he possesses,

95
00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:20.000
Power enough to destroy hundreds of battleships in a matter of minutes,

96
00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.000
He could defeat the Fire Lord now.

97
00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:24.000
But, sir, the thing is, Aang can only do those things

98
00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:26.000
when he's in the Avatar state.

99
00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:28.000
See, it's this special state where--

100
00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:31.000
I'm well aware. Your eyes and tattoos glow,

101
00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:34.000
and you're able to summon unbelievable power.

102
00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:38.000
Without you, we'd be slaughtered before we even reach their shores.

103
00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:41.000
But with you leading the way, as the ultimate weapon,

104
00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:44.000
we could cut a swath right through to the heart of the Fire Nation.

105
00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:49.000
Right, but I don't know how to get in or out of the Avatar state,

106
00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:52.000
much less what to do once I'm there.

107
00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:53.000
FONG: So it's decided, then.

108
00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:56.000
I'll help you figure out how to get into the Avatar state,

109
00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:58.000
and then you'll face your destiny.

110
00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:00.000
No. Nothing's decided.

111
00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.000
We already have a plan.

112
00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:04.000
Aang's pursuing his destiny his way.

113
00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:07.000
FONG: Well, while you take your time learning the elements,

114
00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:10.000
the war goes on.

115
00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:12.000
May I show you something?

116
00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:14.000
That's the infirmary.

117
00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:19.000
And those soldiers are the lucky ones. They came back.

118
00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.000
Every day the Fire Nation takes lives.

119
00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.000
People are dying, Aang.

120
00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:26.000
You could end it now.

121
00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.000
Think about it.

122
00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:48.000
Almost perfect.

123
00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:51.000
One hair out of place.

124
00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:54.000
Almost isn't good enough.

125
00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:01.000
(DISTANT THUNDER)

126
00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.000
General Fong?

127
00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:11.000
Come in, Aang. Have you thought about our discussion?

128
00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:14.000
I'm in.

129
00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:16.000
I'll fight the Fire Lord.

130
00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:30.000
I told the general I'd help him

131
00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:32.000
by going into the Avatar state.

132
00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:35.000
Aang, no. This is not the right way.

133
00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:38.000
Why not? Remember when he took out the fire navy? He was incredible.

134
00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:40.000
There's a right way to do this--

135
00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:42.000
Practice, study, and discipline.

136
00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:45.000
Or just glow it up and stop that Fire Lord.

137
00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:48.000
If you two meatheads want to throw away everything we've worked for, fine.

138
00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:50.000
Go ahead and glow it up.

139
00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:53.000
Katara, I'm just being realistic!

140
00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:56.000
I don't have time to do this the right way.

141
00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:05.000
This rare chi-enhancing tea is a natural stimulant.

142
00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:09.000
In an ordinary warrior, it improves strength and energy tenfold.

143
00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:13.000
In you, it may induce the Avatar state.

144
00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:16.000
Tenfold energy, huh?

145
00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:20.000
Is it working? Is it working?

146
00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:22.000
I can't tell! Somebody tell me if I'm in the Avatar state

147
00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:25.000
'Cause I don't have a good view of myself. Am I talking loud?

148
00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:28.000
I guess he could talk the Fire Lord to death.

149
00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.000
Uh!

150
00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:34.000
Maybe I can shock you into the Avatar state.

151
00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:36.000
I love surprises.

152
00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:40.000
-(SCREECHES) -Aah!

153
00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:43.000
Still not glowing.

154
00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:46.000
Uh! Uh! Aah!

155
00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:53.000
You are wearing a ceremonial piece of clothing

156
00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:55.000
from each of the bending nations.

157
00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:59.000
Now, I will join the four elements into one.

158
00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:05.000
Water, earth, fire, air!

159
00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:09.000
Four elements together as one.

160
00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:11.000
This is just mud.

161
00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:14.000
So, do you feel anything?

162
00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:20.000
(SNEEZES)

163
00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:22.000
We have to find a way.

164
00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:28.000
Look at these magnificent shells.

165
00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:32.000
I'll enjoy these keepsakes for years to come.

166
00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:34.000
We don't need any more useless things.

167
00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:37.000
You forget, we have to carry everything ourselves now.

168
00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:40.000
Hello, brother, uncle.

169
00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:42.000
What are you doing here?

170
00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:46.000
In my country, we exchange a pleasant hello before asking questions.

171
00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:49.000
Have you become uncivilized so soon, Zu Zu?

172
00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:51.000
Don't call me that.

173
00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:54.000
To what do we owe this honor?

174
00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:56.000
Hmm, must be a family trait.

175
00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:59.000
Both of you so quick to get to the point.

176
00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:01.000
I've come with a message from home.

177
00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:06.000
Father's changed his mind. Family is suddenly very important to him.

178
00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:09.000
He's heard rumors of plans to overthrow him--

179
00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:11.000
Treacherous plots.

180
00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:15.000
Family are the only ones you can really trust.

181
00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:20.000
Father regrets your banishment. He wants you home.

182
00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:26.000
Did you hear me? You should be happy, excited, grateful.

183
00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:28.000
I just gave you great news.

184
00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:31.000
I'm sure your brother simply needs a moment--

185
00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:33.000
Don't interrupt, uncle.

186
00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.000
I still haven't heard my thank you.

187
00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:38.000
I'm not a messenger. I didn't have to come all this way.

188
00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:42.000
Father regrets? He wants me back?

189
00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:45.000
I can see you need time to take this in.

190
00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:49.000
I'll come to call on you tomorrow. Good evening.

191
00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:54.000
KATARA: Can we talk about something? AANG: Sure.

192
00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:57.000
Do you remember when we were at the air temple

193
00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:59.000
and you found Monk Gyatso's skeleton?

194
00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:02.000
It must have been so horrible and traumatic for you.

195
00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:06.000
I saw you get so upset that you weren't even you anymore.

196
00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:11.000
I'm not saying the Avatar state doesn't have incredible and helpful power.

197
00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:14.000
But you have to understand, for the people who love you,

198
00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:19.000
watching you be in that much rage and pain is really scary.

199
00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:22.000
I'm really glad you told me that,

200
00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:24.000
But I still need to do this.

201
00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:26.000
I don't understand.

202
00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:27.000
No, you don't.

203
00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:30.000
Every day, more and more people die.

204
00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.000
I'm already a hundred years late.

205
00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:35.000
Defeating the Fire Lord is the only way to stop this war.

206
00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:37.000
I have to try it.

207
00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:39.000
I can't watch you do this to yourself.

208
00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:42.000
I'm not coming tomorrow.

209
00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:45.000
Good night.

210
00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:48.000
We're going home

211
00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:49.000
after three long years.

212
00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:51.000
It's unbelievable.

213
00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:53.000
It is unbelievable.

214
00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:57.000
I have never known my brother to regret anything.

215
00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:59.000
Did you listen to Azula?

216
00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:01.000
Father's realized how important family is to him.

217
00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:03.000
He cares about me.

218
00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:04.000
I care about you.

219
00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:07.000
I mean, if Ozai wants you back, well,

220
00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:11.000
I think it may not be for the reasons you imagine.

221
00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:13.000
You don't know how my father feels about me.

222
00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:14.000
You don't know anything.

223
00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:18.000
Zuko, I only meant that in our family,

224
00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:21.000
things are not always what they seem.

225
00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:23.000
I think you are exactly what you seem--

226
00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:26.000
A lazy, mistrustful, shallow old man

227
00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:29.000
who's always been jealous of his brother.

228
00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:44.000
Aah!

229
00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:52.000
Sokka, Sokka, wake up.

230
00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:53.000
Huh?

231
00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:56.000
I don't think we should be trying to bring on the Avatar state.

232
00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:58.000
-You sure? -Yes.

233
00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:00.000
Ok.

234
00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.000
Do you think the general will be mad?

235
00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:04.000
What can he say? You're the Avatar.

236
00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:06.000
Who knows better than you?

237
00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:14.000
Wait!

238
00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:17.000
Don't leave without me.

239
00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:20.000
Uncle, you've changed your mind.

240
00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:23.000
Family sticks together, right?

241
00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:29.000
We're finally going home.

242
00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:39.000
AANG: The thing is, I don't think we'll ever be able to trigger it on purpose.

243
00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:41.000
So I guess that's it.

244
00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:43.000
Sure I can't change your mind?

245
00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:48.000
I'm sure. I can only reach the Avatar state when I'm in genuine danger.

246
00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:52.000
I see. I was afraid you'd say that.

247
00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:57.000
Aang!

248
00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:59.000
(AANG YELLS)

249
00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:08.000
Men, attack the Avatar.

250
00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:24.000
What are you doing?

251
00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:27.000
I believe we are about to get results.

252
00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:38.000
I'm not your enemy. I won't fight you.

253
00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:16.000
You can't run forever!

254
00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:18.000
You can't fight forever.

255
00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:37.000
Brother, uncle,

256
00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:40.000
welcome.

257
00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:43.000
I'm so glad you decided to come.

258
00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:46.000
Are we ready to depart, your highness?

259
00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:49.000
Set our course for home, captain.

260
00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:50.000
Home.

261
00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:53.000
You heard the princess. Raise the anchors.

262
00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:56.000
We're taking the prisoners home.

263
00:16:57.000 --> 00:17:00.000
Your highness, I...

264
00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:09.000
You lied to me.

265
00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:11.000
Like I've never done that before.

266
00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:14.000
(YELLS)

267
00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:16.000
Aah!

268
00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:21.000
I wonder what crazy thing they're trying now.

269
00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:22.000
(PURRS)

270
00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:24.000
(HEAVY THUDS)

271
00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:27.000
Maybe we should just make sure Aang's ok.

272
00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:31.000
What's going on?

273
00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:32.000
The general's gone crazy.

274
00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:36.000
He's trying to force Aang into the Avatar state.

275
00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:46.000
Good bird-horse thingy.

276
00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:57.000
Maybe you can avoid me, but she can't.

277
00:18:08.000 --> 00:18:10.000
I can't move.

278
00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:12.000
Don't hurt her.

279
00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:20.000
Katara, no!

280
00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:24.000
Whoa!

281
00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:27.000
Stop this! You have to let her go.

282
00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:30.000
You could save her if you were in the Avatar state.

283
00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.000
I'm trying. I'm trying.

284
00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:34.000
Aang, I'm sinking!

285
00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:37.000
I don't see glowing.

286
00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:40.000
Aah! Please.

287
00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:42.000
You don't need to do this.

288
00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:45.000
Apparently, I do.

289
00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:48.000
Aah!

290
00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:53.000
It worked.

291
00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:55.000
It worked!

292
00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:02.000
Aah!

293
00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:18.000
Zuko, let's go!

294
00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:22.000
Hyah! Hyah! Hyah...

295
00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:28.000
You know, father blames uncle for the loss at the North Pole.

296
00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:33.000
And he considers you a miserable failure for not finding the Avatar.

297
00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:34.000
Why would he want you back home,

298
00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:38.000
except to lock you up where you can no longer embarrass him?

299
00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:41.000
(YELLING)

300
00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:12.000
Aah! Uh!

301
00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:21.000
Avatar Aang, can you hear me?

302
00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:23.000
Your friend is safe.

303
00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:26.000
It was just a trick to trigger the Avatar state.

304
00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:29.000
And it worked!

305
00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:53.000
It's time you learned.

306
00:20:58.000 --> 00:21:01.000
The Avatar state is a defense mechanism

307
00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:07.000
designed to empower you with the skills and knowledge of all the past Avatars.

308
00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:11.000
The glow is the combination of all your past lives

309
00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:16.000
focusing their energy through your body.

310
00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:20.000
In the Avatar state,

311
00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:23.000
you are at your most powerful...

312
00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:28.000
But you're also at your most vulnerable.

313
00:21:28.000 --> 00:21:29.000
What do you mean?

314
00:21:29.000 --> 00:21:32.000
If you are killed in the Avatar state,

315
00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:35.000
The reincarnation cycle will be broken

316
00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:40.000
and the Avatar will cease to exist.

317
00:21:56.000 --> 00:22:01.000
I'm sorry, Katara. I hope you never have to see me like that again.

318
00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:04.000
Ha! Are you joking? That was almost perfect.

319
00:22:04.000 --> 00:22:07.000
We just have to find out a way to control you when you're like that.

320
00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:09.000
You're out of your mind.

321
00:22:09.000 --> 00:22:12.000
I guess we'll figure it out on the way to the Fire Nation.

322
00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:15.000
Anybody got a problem with that?

323
00:22:16.000 --> 00:22:20.000
Do you still want an escort to Omashu?

324
00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:22.000
I think we're all set.

325
00:22:27.000 --> 00:22:28.000
Anyone who harbors these traitors

326
00:22:28.000 --> 00:22:31.000
will face the wrath of the Fire Lord.

327
00:22:32.000 --> 00:22:35.000
There will be no place left to hide.

328
00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:43.000
I think we're safe here.

